  "name": "termite",
  "_about": "A subterranean termite (Reticulitermes), a worker 5 mm long: soft and pale cream, its gut showing dark through the thin abdomen; a round yellowish head with beaded antennae and no eyes; a narrow thorax, a long soft segmented abdomen; short legs. Variant: the soldier, with a long hard orange-brown head and long dark sabre jaws for guarding the galleries. Written whole by tools/creaturegen/rework/insects/bugs.py on insectlib.py (jointed legs on a walking gait, the antennae on bones of their own that wave).",
